<BaseLayout title="Studio" description="HS108 is an independent design studio based in India, connecting brand, product, and digital design.">
  <header class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">The studio</p><h1 class="display">Design direction with the whole business in view.</h1><p class="lead">HS108 is an independent design studio based in India. The studio works across identity, industrial product design, digital experience, and the systems that hold them together.</p></header>
  <section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="studio-way-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Our perspective</p><div><h2 class="section-title" id="studio-way-title">The parts should explain each other.</h2><p>A company is encountered through many forms: an identity, an object, a website, an interface, a photograph, a service. HS108's cross-disciplinary perspective helps those encounters tell a coherent story and support a clear business direction.</p></div></div><div class="practice-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">Clarity</p><h3>Know what the work is for.</h3><p>Start from the audience, offer, and business decisions at stake.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Craft</p><h3>Take the details seriously.</h3><p>Consider form, material, language, interaction, and implementation together.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Continuity</p><h3>Build a useful system.</h3><p>Give teams principles and patterns they can apply after the first delivery.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section dark" aria-labelledby="studio-relationship-title"><div class="shell approach-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Working relationship</p><h2 class="section-title" id="studio-relationship-title">Senior design thinking, close to the work.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">The studio is led by senior designers. A useful partnership depends on direct communication, honest recommendations, and a shared understanding of what the work needs to achieve.</p><div class="section-foot"><a class="text-link" href="/why-us">Why work with HS108 ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="studio-programs-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Engagements</p><div><h2 class="section-title" id="studio-programs-title">Projects, discovery, and ongoing direction.</h2><p>The right relationship depends on the question. Explore the studio's programs for continuing support, research-led discovery, and bespoke work.</p><div class="section-foot"><a class="text-link" href="/programs">View programs ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
  <ContactCTA />
</BaseLayout>
